 "remarks": "Prime Location & Move-In Ready- this spacious end-unit 2-bedroom townhouse is available immediately and packed with convenience. Bright open living and dining area with a modern kitchen and powder room on the main level. Two large bedrooms, a full bathroom, and storage attic upstairs. Bonus space - A versatile lower-level room ideal for a home office, gym, or playroom. One attached garage plus 2 additional parking spots, an in-ground community pool, and high-speed fiberoptic internet included in the rent. Walk to Scalzi Park, Mill River Park, and all the dining and entertainment of Downtown Stamford plus quick access to the train station. Drop your bags and start living-schedule a tour today!",
